        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Converge on pricing, discounts, and margin guardrails.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 6784,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've uploaded the first draft of the Bundle Pricing and Margin Model (A2). It's linked to the bundles in A1. Please take a look at the proposed price points and discount tiers. The goal is to get this reviewed and signed off so we can finalize T3.",
